{"availability":"available","full":"mdresch/blog-nextjs-sanity","name":"blog-nextjs-sanity","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-03-10T09:45:43Z","updated":"2026-09-27T19:57:01Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://blog-nextjs-sanity-cbaconsult.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://blog-nextjs-sanity-cbaconsult.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:00.518Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:00.518Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:00.518Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:38:00.518Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This starter is a statically generated blog that uses Next.js for the frontend and Sanity to handle its content. It comes with a native Sanity Studio that offers features like real-time collaboration and visual editing with live updates using Presentation.","The Studio connects to Sanity Content Lake, which gives you hosted content APIs with a flexible query language, on-demand image transformations, powerful patching, and more. You can use this starter to kick-start a blog or learn these technologies.","Note This starter uses the /pages directory for Next.js routing. The template will be migrated to the currently experimental /app directory when Vercel announce that it is production ready."],"features":["A performant, static blog with editable posts, authors, and site settings","A native and customizable authoring environment, accessible on yourblog.com/studio","Real-time and collaborative content editing with fine-grained revision history","Side-by-side instant content preview that works across your whole site","Support for block content and the most advanced custom fields capability in the industry"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mdresch/blog-nextjs-sanity/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"885935b5dc4b9ff4f5d8cd7be72fc3e903f0bf063b7d26a8b79cff1e74